# ricochet

--- TrickshotDude_BounceHeal | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_TRICKSHOT_DUDE_BOUNCE_HEAL_DESC
raw  Rico fires a big bullet that, on hitting a wall or Brawler, splits into <!card.accessory.skill.projectile.chainbullets> smaller bullets.
now  Rico fires a big bullet that, on hitting a wall or Brawler, splits into 3 smaller bullets.
  card.accessory.skill.projectile.chainbullets  3  -> 3

--- TrickshotDude_BounceHeal | gadget | TID_TRICKSHOTDUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Rico fires a big bullet that splits into <!buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.chainbullets> smaller bullets when hitting a wall or enemy Brawlers.\nProjectiles also slow enemies.
now  Rico fires a big bullet that splits into 3 smaller bullets when hitting a wall or enemy Brawlers.\nProjectiles also slow enemies.
  buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.chainbullets  3  -> 3

--- TrickshotDude_ShootAround | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_RICO_SHOOT_AROUND_DESC
raw  Rico Deploys a vending machine that has <!card.accessory.skill.summonedcharacter.maxhealth.scaleStatToLevel> health - when destroyed fires bouncing projectiles in all directions.
now  Rico Deploys a vending machine that has 4000 health - when destroyed fires bouncing projectiles in all directions.
  card.accessory.skill.summonedcharacter.maxhealth.scaleStatToLevel  4000  -> 4000

--- TrickshotDude_ShootAround | gadget | TID_TRICKSHOTDUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Rico deploys a vending machine with <!buddy.accessory.skill.summonedcharacter.maxhealth.scaleStatToLevel> health. Rico can bounce attacks off the vending machine until it explodes, firing bouncing projectiles in all directions. When Rico bounces bullets off the vending machine, extra bullets are added to it when it explodes
now  Rico deploys a vending machine with 4000 health. Rico can bounce attacks off the vending machine until it explodes, firing bouncing projectiles in all directions. When Rico bounces bullets off the vending machine, extra bullets are added to it when it explodes
  buddy.accessory.skill.summonedcharacter.maxhealth.scaleStatToLevel  4000  -> 4000

--- TrickshotDude_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_BOUNCED_BULLETS_STRONGER_DESC
raw  Rico's bullets, from attack and Super alike, get Supercharged by their first bounce and deal +<VALUE1> damage!
now  Rico's bullets, from attack and Super alike, get Supercharged by their first bounce and deal +40 damage!
  VALUE1  40  -> 240

--- TrickshotDude_unique | star power | TID_TRICKSHOTDUDE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DESC
raw  After their first bounce, bullets from Rico's Main Attack and Super deal +<!card.value1.scaleweapondamagelevel.scaleStatToLevel> damage and give <!buddy.trait.value>% Super charge on hit.
now  After their first bounce, bullets from Rico's Main Attack and Super deal +240 damage and give 10% Super charge on hit.
  card.value1.scaleweapondamagelevel.scaleStatToLevel  240  -> 240
  buddy.trait.value  10  -> 10

--- TrickshotDude_unique | star power | TID_TRICKSHOTDUDE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DIFF
raw  Bounced bullets also give <!buddy.trait.value>% Super charge on hit.
now  Bounced bullets also give 10% Super charge on hit.
  buddy.trait.value  10  -> 10

--- TrickshotDude_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_SPEED_LOW_HEALTH_DESC
raw  Rico runs <!card.component[0].values[2]>% faster when his health falls below <!card.component[0].values[0]>%.
now  Rico runs 35% faster when his health falls below 40%.
  card.component[0].values[2]  35  -> 35
  card.component[0].values[0]  40  -> 40

--- TrickshotDude_unique_2 | star power | TID_TRICKSHOTDUDE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DESC
raw  Rico moves <!card.component[0].values[2]>% faster when his health falls below <!card.component[0].values[0]>%. Movement speed increases up to <!card.component[0].values[3]>% at <!card.component[0].values[1]>% health.
now  Rico moves 35% faster when his health falls below 40%. Movement speed increases up to 50% at 10% health.
  card.component[0].values[2]  35  -> 35
  card.component[0].values[0]  40  -> 40
  card.component[0].values[3]  50  -> 50
  card.component[0].values[1]  10  -> 10

--- TrickshotDude_unique_2 | star power | TID_TRICKSHOTDUDE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DIFF
raw  Increase movement speed by up to <!card.component[0].values[3]>% when Rico is at <!card.component[0].values[1]>% health.
now  Increase movement speed by up to 50% when Rico is at 10% health.
  card.component[0].values[3]  50  -> 50
  card.component[0].values[1]  10  -> 10
